WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:20.266
Susie worked on a jigsaw puzzle in her kitchen.

2
00:00:20.267 --> 00:00:25.382
"Meow!" Her cat pawed at the back door.

3
00:00:25.383 --> 00:00:29.958
"You can't go outside right now, Snowball," said Susie.

4
00:00:29.959 --> 00:00:33.955
"Meow!" Snowball pawed some more.

5
00:00:33.956 --> 00:00:38.133
"Not right now, Snowball," said Susie.

6
00:00:38.134 --> 00:00:40.575
"You just had a haircut and—"

7
00:00:40.576 --> 00:00:46.629
"MEOW!" Suddenly Snowball grew sharp fangs and spiky hair.

8
00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:51.577
Phwoof! She spit out a flaming hairball.

9
00:00:51.578 --> 00:00:53.559
Smoke filled the kitchen.

10
00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:56.529
When the smoke cleared, the door was gone.

11
00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:00.902
And so was Snowball.

12
00:01:00.903 --> 00:01:04.918
"Sit, Max!" said Mara. "Sit!"

13
00:01:04.919 --> 00:01:07.525
Roxy and her friends were at Metro City Park.

14
00:01:07.526 --> 00:01:10.608
They were trying to train Mara's new dog, Max.

15
00:01:10.609 --> 00:01:13.408
But Max wasn't listening.

16
00:01:13.409 --> 00:01:17.734
"Max, you need to sit," said Mara.

17
00:01:17.735 --> 00:01:25.206
"Woof!" Max barked. Then he lay down and yawned.

18
00:01:25.207 --> 00:01:29.348
"Maybe sitting is too boring for Max," said Jack.

19
00:01:29.349 --> 00:01:33.563
"We should teach him some exciting tricks."

20
00:01:33.564 --> 00:01:38.757
Jack ran to a tree. "Max!" he called. "Come!"

21
00:01:38.758 --> 00:01:43.369
Max rolled onto his side.

22
00:01:43.370 --> 00:01:47.040
Terrell held out his hand. "Give me your paw, Max."

23
00:01:47.041 --> 00:01:48.848
Max sat up.

24
00:01:48.849 --> 00:01:51.766
"He likes this trick!" said Terrell.

25
00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:57.180
But Max just scratched behind his ear and then lay back down.

26
00:01:57.181 --> 00:02:01.355
Mara sighed. "This is hopeless.

27
00:02:01.356 --> 00:02:05.516
Max can't learn any tricks."

28
00:02:05.517 --> 00:02:08.824
Jack sat down next to Max and patted his head.

29
00:02:08.825 --> 00:02:11.654
"I'm sure Max can learn tricks.

30
00:02:11.655 --> 00:02:14.621
He just needs more time."

31
00:02:14.622 --> 00:02:17.221
Roxy scratched Max behind the ear.

32
00:02:17.222 --> 00:02:22.023
"Max is a good pet, Mara," she said. "He's just a bit—"

33
00:02:22.024 --> 00:02:25.083
"Boring," said Mara.

34
00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:28.873
"There's nothing wrong with being boring," said Jack.

35
00:02:28.874 --> 00:02:32.958
Mara frowned. "I want Max to be super."

36
00:02:32.959 --> 00:02:37.224
"Yeah! A super dog would be cool!" said Terrell.

37
00:02:37.225 --> 00:02:40.362
"Maybe we could get Rocket Girl to train Max.

38
00:02:40.363 --> 00:02:43.166
She could make him really super!"

39
00:02:43.167 --> 00:02:51.461
Roxy laughed. "I don't think Rocket Girl knows how to train pets, Terrell."

40
00:02:51.462 --> 00:02:58.013
"You're probably right," said Terrell. He patted Max.

41
00:02:58.014 --> 00:03:00.275
Roxy jumped to her feet.

42
00:03:00.276 --> 00:03:02.471
"I just thought of something, Mara!

43
00:03:02.472 --> 00:03:05.551
Max definitely knows one trick."

44
00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:09.626
"What?" said Mara. Her eyes lit up.

45
00:03:09.627 --> 00:03:14.784
Roxy looked at Max sternly. "Max, stay!"

46
00:03:14.785 --> 00:03:17.212
By now Max was snoring quietly.

47
00:03:17.213 --> 00:03:20.313
He didn't move at all.

48
00:03:20.314 --> 00:03:22.761
"See?" Roxy grinned.

49
00:03:22.762 --> 00:03:26.796
Terrell and Jack laughed. Mara frowned.

50
00:03:26.797 --> 00:03:32.644
Just then Roxy heard her watch beep.

51
00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:37.591
She moved away from her friends.

52
00:03:37.592 --> 00:03:42.192
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy whispered. "Is there a problem?"

53
00:03:42.193 --> 00:03:46.467
"There is a terrible problem, Rocket Girl!" cried the mayor.

54
00:03:46.468 --> 00:03:53.185
"Monster pets are running all over West Street!"
